[1mFull exported surface (definition of done).[22m Both a hand-rolled [38;5;10mgcc -shared -O2[0m build and the real CMake build of [38;5;10mc_src[0m export exactly five symbols: [38;5;10mbad[0m, [38;5;10mdriver[0m, [38;5;10mgood[0m, [38;5;10mprintIntLine[0m, [38;5;10mprintLine[0m. [38;5;10mgoodG2B[0m and [38;5;10mgoodB2G[0m are [38;5;10mstatic[0m, so they are not part of the ABI and stayed private in Rust. [38;5;10mnm -D --defined-only[0m on [38;5;10mtranslation/target/release/libdriver.so[0m gives the identical set — [38;5;10mcomm -3[0m between the two lists is empty in both directions, so no symbol is missing and none is extra. The header declares no namespace-renaming macros, so no symbol names needed rewriting.[0m[0m
