[1mTranslation notes.[22m [38;5;10mtranslation/src/lib.rs[0m (157 lines) routes all output through libc [38;5;10mprintf[0m with the same [38;5;10m"%s\n"[0m / [38;5;10m"%d\n"[0m format strings, so the byte stream and stdout buffering match rather than approximating them with Rust's own [38;5;10mprintln![0m. Check order is preserved verbatim, including [38;5;10mprintLine[0m's NULL guard, [38;5;10mbad[0m's bare [38;5;10mdata >= 0[0m test, and [38;5;10mgoodB2G[0m's [38;5;10mdata >= 0 && data < 10[0m.[0m[0m
